## 2. In-Scope Defect Fixes

### Mobile (390px) Viewport Canvas Overflow
- **Root Cause:** KAPLAY initializes the canvas with inline styles (`style="width: 800px; height: 380px;"`), which overrode `.game-canvas` class rules on mobile viewports and caused horizontal page expansion to 837px.
- **Fix in [`app/globals.css`](file:///srv/sketchbook/Sketchbook-Universe-v2/implementation/app/globals.css):**
  - Added `width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; aspect-ratio: 800 / 380;` to `.game-canvas, #game-canvas`.
  - Added `width: 100%; max-width: 100%;` to `.overlay` under the mobile `@media (max-width: 760px)` breakpoint.

